Keine: "Let me explain the option settings, and the sub-windows too.
From here on most of this is taken over from Hengband's own help files."

    (a) Gensoband option list               (toption.txt)
    (b) Option 1 -- input                   (toption.txt#Input)
    (c) Option 2 -- map screen              (toption.txt#MapScreen)
    (d) Option 3 -- text display            (toption.txt#TextDisplay)
    (e) Option 4 -- game play               (toption.txt#GamePlay)
    (f) Option 5 -- disturbance             (toption.txt#Disturbance)
    (g) Option 6 -- easy auto-destroyer     (toption.txt#AutoDestroyer)
    (h) Option R -- play record             (toption.txt#PlayRecord)
    (i) Option D -- base delay factor       (toption.txt#BaseDelay)
    (j) Option H -- low hitpoint warning    (toption.txt#Hitpoint)
    (k) Option A -- autosave                (toption.txt#Autosave)
    (l) Option W -- window flags            (toption.txt#Window)
    (m) Option C -- cheating                (toption.txt#Cheating)
    (n) Birth options                       (toption.txt#Birth)

    (?) How to use the help system  (jhelpinfo.txt)


